{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Serge, or Mr.Cookie is a sweet, shy and observant kitty! He loves to play and roll around on carpets. He will never turn down a tube treat or a minnow and wants to hang out and watch what you are doing. Serge loves having his own safe space and will hide when he is overwhelmed but always comes back out when he's ready. Anyone would be lucky to have Mr. Cookie in their home!\n\nMy foster writes: Serge has been lovingly nicknamed Cookie! Cookie is getting braver ever day and getting used to being around people. He still hides when anyone approaches him and does not tolerate being touched but he loves to watch you! Cookie loves his tube treats and is starting to be more playful at night! He needs someone who is patient and will give him lots of space and time to come to you.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=4&searchType=4&animalid=192300","id":"b198db62a4c0b3a2383b5e96e5b10179","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5d372978fa4d4483af45b7a4093b342d-1772644114-1772644127-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/b98936d1297a4021b79f7cbe4b4c5742-1772644114-1772644114-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/55df4274ade44b0ca721bdc22630e3fc-1772644114-1772644114-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/9b32a1ff5b29454085257053a951d084-1772644114-1772644114-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/d3469879c5bc4882b25d5346c237d8eb-1772644114-1772644114-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/0bd70d46010d417db789331098a983e5-1762785954-1762786008-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/stor